<title>ESTONIA: FINAL DATA SHOWS NO BOURSE RECORD.</title>
<headline>FINAL DATA SHOWS NO BOURSE RECORD.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Final corrected data on the Estonian bourse on Wednesday showed that the session turned over 110.7 million kroons, not the record 146 million kroons suggested by preliminary data.</p>
<p>The mistake stemmed from a double registration of shares in construction company EMV, which turned over 40.4 million kroons, not the 76 million kroons recorded in the initial closing data.</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn newsroom, +372 6209 201, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
